---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-ink/90 mt-24 border-t-2">
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-5 py-12 sm:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr_1fr] sm:px-8"
  >
    <div>
      <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Living Whitepaper</p>
      <p class="text-ink-muted mt-3 max-w-md text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed">
        A living record of AI adoption across Aotearoa New Zealand — researched and
        written by an AI agent, reviewed by the community, and updated as the
        landscape evolves.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-ink-muted text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase">
        Project
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-[0.95rem]">
        <li><a class="hover:text-pounamu-deep underline decoration-rule underline-offset-4 transition-colors" href="/whitepaper/">Articles</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-pounamu-deep underline decoration-rule underline-offset-4 transition-colors" href="/how-it-works/">How it works</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-pounamu-deep underline decoration-rule underline-offset-4 transition-colors" href="/about/">About</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-ink-muted text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase">
        Elsewhere
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-[0.95rem]">
        <li><a class="hover:text-pounamu-deep underline decoration-rule underline-offset-4 transition-colors" href="https://github.com/mingnz/livingwp">GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-pounamu-deep underline decoration-rule underline-offset-4 transition-colors" href="https://aiforum.org.nz">AI Forum NZ</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-pounamu-deep underline decoration-rule underline-offset-4 transition-colors" href="/feed.xml">RSS feed</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-rule border-t">
    <p
      class="font-mono text-ink-muted mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-4 text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase sm:px-8"
    >
      © {year} AI Forum New Zealand · Open source · Researched by AI, reviewed by humans
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
